      "path": "SKILL.md",
      "encoding": "utf8",
      "content": "---\nname: catalog\ndescription: \"This package owns detached catalog metadata for official VCO skills.\"\n---\n\n# catalog\n\nThis package owns detached catalog metadata for official VCO skills.\n\n## 中文说明\n\nCatalog 是 Claude Code 的能力扩展，用来处理对应领域里的文件、网页、数据或自动化流程。\n\n## 典型场景\n- 使用 Catalog 完成相关任务\n- 减少手工复制、整理和重复操作\n- 把固定流程交给 Claude Code 执行"
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "encoding": "utf8",
      "content": "# Skill Catalog\n\nThis package owns detached catalog metadata for official VCO skills.\n\nIt is not a runtime owner.\nIt exists so installer and distribution layers can consume catalog descriptors without traversing bundled runtime topology.\n"
    },
